DSS --> UC49 : generates confidence
DSS --> UC50 : analyzes sensitivity
DSS --> UC51 : ranks alternatives
DSS --> UC52 : explains methodology

' System automatic processes
DSS --> UC53 : sends notifications
DSS --> UC54 : updates status
DSS --> UC55 : generates reports
DSS --> UC56 : logs activities
DSS --> UC57 : sends reminders
DSS --> UC58 : validates rules
DSS --> UC59 : enforces limits
DSS --> UC60 : maintains integrity
DSS --> UC61 : performs backups
DSS --> UC62 : handles errors

