' Notes for Enhanced DSS features
note right of UC20
  **Enhanced DSS Analysis Includes:**

  • Critical competency veto thresholds
  • Progressive bonus calculations (up to 20%)
  • Location intelligence scoring (15% weight)
  • Mathematical SAW compliance validation
  • Multi-factor confidence assessment
  • Sensitivity analysis for top candidates
  • Academic weight distribution rules
  • Edge case handling (zero-range normalization)
end note

note left of UC12
  **Critical Competency Configuration:**

  • Maximum 70% of competencies can be critical
  • Veto threshold range: 60-100%
  • Automatic elimination below threshold
  • Progressive bonus for exceeding requirements
  • Business rule validation and enforcement
end note

note bottom of UC47
  **SAW Algorithm Implementation:**

  Formula: Final_Score = (Competency_Score × 0.85) + (Location_Score × 0.15)

  Standards Compliance:
  • International MCDM/SAW methodology
  • Min-max normalization with edge cases
  • Mathematical bounds enforcement [0,1]
  • Academic weight validation rules
end note

note top of UC22
  **Dual Algorithm Comparison:**

  Enhanced DSS (10 results):
  • Advanced filtering and scoring
  • Critical competency features
  • Location intelligence

  Basic SAW (5 results):
  • Standard implementation
  • Comparison baseline
  • Academic reference
end note

@enduml
